  "label": "Former U.S. President and First Lady",
  "description": "Barack Obama and Michelle Obama are a well-known, respected public couple who served as the 44th President and First Lady of the United States. Their public image is one of dignity, love, and national unity. The meme uses their image to create a powerful contrast with the derogatory term 'tranny', which is intended to demean and insult transgender people by associating them with a symbol of respectability and love.",
